stateDiagram-v2
    state "退款进行中" as RefundActive
    state "等待退款订单号" as RefundCollect
    state "退款任务已暂停" as RefundPaused
    state "物流查询进行中" as LogisticsActive
    state "物流查询完成" as LogisticsDone
    state "退款任务已恢复" as RefundResumed
    state "等待退款原因" as RefundReason
    state "退款流程完成" as RefundDone
    [*] --> RefundActive: start_flow(refund_request)
    RefundActive --> RefundCollect: 缺少 order_number
    RefundCollect --> RefundPaused: 用户转而查物流
    note right of RefundPaused
      退款 TaskContext 进入 paused_tasks
      原 step_id 与 slots 保留
    end note
    RefundPaused --> LogisticsActive: start_flow(logistics_tracking)
    LogisticsActive --> LogisticsDone: 填入订单号并查询物流
    LogisticsDone --> RefundResumed: resume_flow(refund_request)
    RefundResumed --> RefundCollect: 恢复原 TaskContext
    RefundCollect --> RefundReason: set_slots(order_number)
    RefundReason --> RefundDone: set_slots(refund_reason)
    RefundDone --> [*]
